# Game Repository Instructions

Before designing or editing in this repository, read:

1. This repository's `README.md`, relevant project and source files, and every
   applicable local `AGENTS.md` from the root to each target directory.
2. `../AlvorKit/docs/GameRepositoryInstructions.md`.
3. Every topic policy routed by that shared game guide for the intended paths
   and operation. Read `../AlvorKit/AGENTS.md` and applicable scoped AlvorKit
   instructions before designing a solution that changes AlvorKit.

Repeat the preflight if the solution scope expands. Do not assume another
sibling game repository exists.

## Local Overrides

None.
